    <briefdescription>
<para>Tamper-evident append-only audit log interface. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each appended entry&apos;s hash includes the hash of the previous entry, forming an HMAC-SHA-256 chain. The interface is append-only: no delete or update methods exist. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
